        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 “Nang hei suai zat mak ge,” he aPu Ravguangc,",
            "He Ravguangc, Nang thu sii guay gay guay mak,",
            "Nang kalaic mak Nang zauzian suai zat mak ge,",
            "Kahunungc kumc tingsaeng nai bam puni.",
            "",
            "“Nang hei suai zat mak ge,”(2)",
            "Lauthwan kathuic khou zauzian thanh how e;",
            "Akhang gaengmei kaguay Nang tiilou bam e,",
            "“Nang hei suai zat mak ge,” Kaipouc, akhang!",
            "2 Lauphunhswan, lautay ganv, tinglwm, tingsei )}3,",
            "Tingpuk kauh thangc bw, neih, gaanchuangc guay )}3",
            "Kalwnlung baansyam )}3 Nang sakhi sw e;",
            "Nang tuang suai makmei lev Nang zauzian ta.",
            "",
            "3 Paapc kuakloumei hei lev lungning chuzaenghmei,",
            "Nang bam ’chamcna tiineihlaa, zayloumei,",
            "’Seic khang pumtan, ’thuanh khang gay ranvmei machunc,",
            "Hei na hamhmei suaihiam guay akhang e."
          ]
        }
      },
